# Discarding down to the maximum hand size is the rules' own action, not one a spell or ability causes (CR 514.1): Bot1, with
# eight cards at the cleanup step of turn 3 (it plays nothing), discards its Wilt-Leaf Liege and it goes to the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Wilt-Leaf Liege
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x18

[Actions]
[T3 Bot1.End]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Discard(Wilt-Leaf Liege)

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Wilt-Leaf Liege
Bot1.Hand.Count = 7
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 0
